auto":"1春，正月，辛丑，葬孝宣皇帝于杜陵；赦天下。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2188,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"914b1fa4-db0e-11ef-b600-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"陽平侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"阳平侯","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"914b1fad-db0e-11ef-aa16-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"東郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"东郡","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"914b1fae-db0e-11ef-b580-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"恩澤侯表，陽平侯食邑於東郡。","note_content_jianti_auto":"恩泽侯表，阳平侯食邑于东郡。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"914b1fac-db0e-11ef-b4ab-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"爵位","official_name":"陽平侯","official_note":"陽平侯是漢代的爵位，通常授予功臣或外戚，表示封地或榮譽。在此上下文中，王禁因女兒被立為皇后而受封，體現了外戚在漢代政治中的影響力。","official_rank":"侯爵","source_snippet":"封后父禁爲陽平侯","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"685c7fb4-b605-4dec-b69b-06e6a5250f78"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-71,"link_death_year":13,"link_td_description":"王政君，魏郡元城县（今河北省大名县）人，汉元帝刘奭皇后，汉成帝刘骜生母。父王禁，母李亲。她是中国历史上寿命最长的皇后之一。其身居后位（包含皇后、皇太后、太皇太后）时间长达61年（公元前49年—公元13年在位）。王政君是王莽的姑姑。","link_td_id":"Q10008478","link_td_number_id":279744,"people_name":"王氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"王氏","people_xingming":"王政君","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"914b1fb0-db0e-11ef-bb19-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[刘奭本年二十八岁]"},{"link_death_year":-42,"link_td_description":"王禁，字稚君，魏郡元城县人（今河北省大名东），西汉政治人物。濟北王田安後裔，王贺之子，王莽之祖父。","link_td_id":"Q10007505","link_td_number_id":1295576,"people_name":"禁","people_name_jianti_auto":"禁","people_xingming":"王禁","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"914b1fb1-db0e-11ef-95b3-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[刘奭本年二十八岁]"},{"link_death_year":-42,"link_td_description":"王禁，字稚君，魏郡元城县人（今河北省大名东），西汉政治人物。濟北王田安後裔，王贺之子，王莽之祖父。","link_td_id":"Q10007505","link_td_number_id":1295576,"people_name":"陽平侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"阳平侯","people_xingming":"王禁","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"914b1fb2-db0e-11ef-81db-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[刘奭本年二十八岁]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"2三月，丙午，立皇后王氏，封后父禁爲陽平侯。","content_fanyi":"三月丙午日，汉元帝册立王政君为皇后，封皇后的父亲王禁为阳平侯。","content_jianti_auto":"2三月，丙午，立皇后王氏，封后父禁为阳平侯。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2189,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"914b1fab-db0e-11ef-8581-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"914b1fb5-db0e-11ef-a079-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"太常掌諸陵邑，故亦有公田苑。師古曰：振業，振起之令有作業。","note_content_jianti_auto":"太常掌诸陵邑，故亦有公田苑。师古曰：振业，振起之令有作业。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"914b1fb4-db0e-11ef-bf04-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"914b1fb7-db0e-11ef-a6a9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"賈公彥","people_name_jianti_auto":"贾公彦","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"914b1fb8-db0e-11ef-aaa6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：賦，給與之也。貸，假也。種，音之勇翻。賈公彥曰：種食者，或爲種子，或爲食用。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：赋，给与之也。贷，假也。种，音之勇翻。贾公彦曰：种食者，或为种子，或为食用。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"914b1fb6-db0e-11ef-9da7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"三輔","official_note":"三輔指漢代京畿地區的三個行政區劃，包括京兆尹、左馮翊、右扶風，負責管理首都周邊地區。在上下文中，三輔與太常、郡國公田並列，表示這些地區的公共土地被用於救濟貧民。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"以三輔、太常、郡國公田及苑可省者振業貧民","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"1e7760c2-8163-4fcb-8527-b450a49fdc57"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"文教","official_name":"太常","official_note":"太常是漢代九卿之一，掌管宗廟禮儀、祭祀和教育事務。在上下文中，太常的公共土地被用於救濟貧民，顯示其職能可能涉及土地管理。","official_rank":"九卿之一","source_snippet":"以三輔、太常、郡國公田及苑可省者振業貧民","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"ac44e13e-861d-49e3-8900-435cdf38d0df"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"914b1fb3-db0e-11ef-a1e9-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"zī","source_anchor_text":"振業貧民貲不滿千錢","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":22,"text":"貲","tongjian_id":"0d191943-5e66-5a69-b6f7-0659597a96dd"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"三輔","place_name_jianti_auto":"三辅","resolved_place_entity_id":476,"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"914b1fb9-db0e-11ef-8e66-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"3以三輔、太常、郡國公田及苑可省者振業貧民；貲不滿千錢者，賦貸種、食。","content_fanyi":"将三辅、太常、各郡、国的公田和可以减省的苑囿，用来赈济贫民，使他们获得生计；家产不足一千钱的，发给或借给种子和粮食。","content_jianti_auto":"3以三辅、太常、郡国公田及苑可省者振业贫民；赀不满千钱者，赋贷种、食。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2190,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"914b1fb3-db0e-11ef-a1e9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"文穎","people_name_jianti_auto":"文颖","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"914b1fbc-db0e-11ef-866b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"戴侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"戴侯","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"914b1fbd-db0e-11ef-aa05-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"許廣漢","people_name_jianti_auto":"许广汉","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"914b1fbe-db0e-11ef-8f5b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"廣漢","people_name_jianti_auto":"广汉","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"914b1fbf-db0e-11ef-8747-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"嘉","people_name_jianti_auto":"嘉","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"914b1fc0-db0e-11ef-b7fb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"西都","place_name_jianti_auto":"西都","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"914b1fc1-db0e-11ef-affc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東都","place_name_jianti_auto":"东都","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"914b1fc2-db0e-11ef-91df-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"文穎曰：戴侯，許廣漢。諡法，典禮不愆曰戴。余按廣漢先坐腐刑，及薨，無後；今以嘉紹封。百官表：侍中、中常侍皆加官。西都參用士人，東都始以宦者爲中常侍。","note_content_jianti_auto":"文颖曰：戴侯，许广汉。谥法，典礼不愆曰戴。余按广汉先坐腐刑，及薨，无后；今以嘉绍封。百官表：侍中、中常侍皆加官。西都参用士人，东都始以宦者为中常侍。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"914b1fbb-db0e-11ef-8c3d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢近臣","official_name":"中常侍","official_note":"中常侍是汉代官职，负责侍从皇帝、传达诏令，常由宦官担任，此处许嘉担任此职，表明其亲近皇帝的地位。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"中常侍許嘉","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"2fc3581c-57c7-4562-adfc-267b1492a0bb"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-117,"link_death_year":-61,"link_td_description":"许广汉，昌邑（今山东省金乡县）人，西汉宦官，平恩侯，汉宣帝皇后许平君之父。","link_td_id":"Q10004577","link_td_number_id":1274030,"people_name":"平恩戴侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"平恩戴侯","people_xingming":"许广汉","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"914b1fc5-db0e-11ef-a17b-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-28,"link_td_description":"许嘉，昌邑（今山东省金乡县）人，西汉大司马、外戚。","link_td_id":"Q10