,"official_category":"文教娱乐","official_name":"樂府","official_note":"樂府是汉代掌管音乐、歌舞和诗歌的机构，其官员负责宫廷娱乐和祭祀音乐。在此段中，皇帝下令减少樂府的员额，作为应对疾疫、节省开支以赈济困乏的措施之一，反映了汉代在灾荒时期调整宫廷机构以减轻财政负担的做法。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"減樂府員","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"537b1f8e-34bc-4744-ac33-dd301bb242a4"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"5夏，六月，以民疾疫，令太官損膳，減樂府員，省苑馬，以振困乏。","content_fanyi":"夏季六月，因民间瘟疫流行，汉元帝下令太官减省膳食，裁减乐府人员，减省苑马，用来赈济困乏的百姓。","content_jianti_auto":"5夏，六月，以民疾疫，令太官损膳，减乐府员，省苑马，以振困乏。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2192,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"914b1fc8-db0e-11ef-b17c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"914b1fcf-db0e-11ef-9afe-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"914b1fd0-db0e-11ef-aa15-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：乙十一行本「關」上有「秋九月」三字；孔本同；傳校同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：乙十一行本「关」上有「秋九月」三字；孔本同；传校同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"914b1fce-db0e-11ef-a698-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"914b1fcd-db0e-11ef-9802-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"關","place_name_jianti_auto":"关","res